# engineering-preflight

Apply the engineering-preflight skill when the request matches its scope.

Capabilities:
- produce EngineeringPreflightArtifact
- validate requirement-to-release traceability
- classify explicit exceptions and their expiry

Stop when: A current EngineeringPreflightArtifact is approved before software-changing work, or an explicit bounded exception is recorded and approved.
